Jacek Dziedzic wrote:
> BWIGLEY wrote:

>    So it's not good to be satiated? What intrinsics do you have in
> mind? By accidentally do you mean that the player hits 'e' by
> accident or can you actually "accidentally eat" under some
> circumstances in the game?

Eating some corpses can give you intrinsics. Eating when you are
satiated may kill you. You should only eat corpses that have just been
killed. Hence, you don't want to be satiated so you may always eat
something you just killed.

